      en: ["San Lazaro is located approximately 12 miles southwest of Orange Walk Town.", "The village is a major contributor to the northern Belize sugarcane industry.", "The population consists almost entirely of Spanish-speaking Mestizo families.", "Traditional patron saint festivals (Fiestas) are a central part of community life.", "The village features a primary school and an active local council.", "It is surrounded by some of the most productive agricultural land in the district.", "The community has a strong tradition of cattle ranching alongside crop farming."]
