      en: ["Libertad was once the industrial heart of the Belizean sugar industry.", "The decommissioned Libertad Sugar Factory is a major local landmark.", "The village is beautifully situated on the banks of the New River.", "Libertad features a well-planned layout with wide streets and community spaces.", "The population is ethnically mixed, including Creole and Mestizo families.", "It is located about 9 miles south of Corozal Town.", "The village is known for its exceptionally quiet and safe residential environment.", "Artisanal fishing in the New River is a common supplementary livelihood."]
