      en: ["Santa Elena is the main official border crossing between Belize and Mexico.", "The community is home to the Corozal Free Zone, a major tax-free shopping area.", "The border crossing is situated directly on the banks of the Río Hondo.", "It represents the northernmost inhabited point of the Belizean mainland.", "Santa Elena is a major regional hub for international trade and logistics.", "The area features numerous large casinos and hotels catering to tourists.", "A modern international bridge (Chactemal Bridge) now handles the majority of traffic.", "The border and commercial zone operate 24 hours a day, 7 days a week."]
